00:01:02.076 --> 00:01:07.676
Let's go. So an agent does three things right.

00:01:07.716 --> 00:01:09.596
The first one is reasoning.

00:01:11.596 --> 00:01:15.596
A large language model doesn't just do text generations.

00:01:16.556 --> 00:01:22.596
They can understand a request,
break it down into steps and create a plan.

00:01:23.396 --> 00:01:24.756
And this is reasoning.

00:01:26.556 --> 00:01:28.636
Well the second thing is act.

00:01:29.796 --> 00:01:35.316
Reasoning alone is not enough.
The agent has to do something in the real world.

00:01:35.916 --> 00:01:44.596
They use tools. It can be something like an API call
an NCP server or they want to communicate with the human.

00:01:45.116 --> 00:01:48.436
So think of the tools as the agent's hands.

00:01:50.076 --> 00:01:59.556
And also you have. Remember, without memory,
agent will have to start each turn of this conversation from scratch.

00:02:00.556 --> 00:02:07.276
While the agent has to hold on to its instructions,
its context and conversation histories.

00:02:07.796 --> 00:02:10.396
So memory is what ties it all together.

00:02:11.876 --> 00:02:14.316
And here's where it becomes quite interesting.

00:02:14.876 --> 00:02:24.716
So if you put all those three steps into a loop,
so we have reasoning act and remember and repeat,

00:02:25.396 --> 00:02:30.796
right. You get something powerful.
The agent doesn't just do one thing and stop.

00:02:31.516 --> 00:02:39.996
It can start to plan and do one step,
check the result and decide what to do next.

00:02:41.796 --> 00:02:44.836
As a result, the agent can course correct itself.

00:02:45.276 --> 00:02:46.876
It can handle surprises.

00:02:48.036 --> 00:02:52.116
And this loop is what we call a reactive pattern.

00:02:52.836 --> 00:02:57.196
And this is the foundation of every Agentic AI system,

00:02:58.356 --> 00:03:01.996
right? Let me show you how it works with an example.

00:03:02.276 --> 00:03:07.916
So let's meet Terry. Terry is a customer of any company insurance.

00:03:08.356 --> 00:03:13.756
He wants to buy car insurance.
